2026-10-31  Kival  <Kival@hypermath.org>

	* include/hyper_math/core/prng.hpp (random_engine::get_state,
	random_engine::set_state): Add public state snapshot and restore
	methods so downstream consumers do not need strict-aliasing workarounds.
	* include/hyper_math/core/parallel.hpp (thread_pool::thread_pool,
	parallel_for): Cap default worker thread count to 8 P-cores on hybrid
	CPUs and capture exceptions inside the OpenMP parallel_for region to
	rethrow after the barrier instead of calling std::terminate.
	* include/hyper_math/tensor/reductions.hpp (matmul): Add 4-row
	register-blocked microkernel for 2D matrix multiplication.

